  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n**(3)/(70)+ (1)/(42)+(1)/(66)+(3)/(286)+(1)/(130)+(1)/(170)** = ?\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nAddition of fractions by taking L.C.M.\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(3)/(70)+ (1)/(42)+(1)/(66)+(3)/(286)+(1)/(130)+(1)/(170)\n\n⇒ ((3)/(70) + (1)/(42)) + ((1)/(66) + (3)/(286)) + ((1)/(130) + (1)/(170))\n\n⇒ (9 + 5)/(210) + (13 + 9)/(858) + (17 + 13)/(2210)\n\n⇒ (14)/(210) + (22)/(858) + (30)/(2210)\n\n⇒ (1)/(15) + (1)/(39) + (3)/(221)\n\n⇒ ((1)/(15) + (1)/(39)) + (3)/(221)\n\n⇒ (13 + 5)/(195) + (3)/(221)\n\n⇒ (18)/(195) + (3)/(221)\n\n⇒ (6)/(65) + (3)/(221)\n\n⇒ (6 times 17 + 3 times 5)/(1105)\n\n⇒ (102 + 15)/(1105)\n\n⇒ (117)/(1105) = (9)/(85)\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (3).**</p",
